WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.980
The truth is we don't know if North

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:08.700
Korea has the ability to hit the United

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.469
States with an intercontinental

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:12.840
ballistic missile. If we wanted to shoot

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.309
it down, the only way we could be

00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:16.740
reasonably certain of doing so is to get

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.510
in what we call the "boost phase". That's

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.119
what's lifting off from North Korea. It's

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:22.859
probably impossible for us, at this point,

00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:24.720
to have a certainty of getting it when

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.279
it's coming down in the "terminal phase".

00:00:26.279 --> 00:00:29.369
Also, if we did that, we would forfeit the

00:00:29.369 --> 00:00:31.230
opportunity to gather intelligence on

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.210
just how advanced the missile program is.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.340
There's also no assurance that they'd be

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.840
shooting it toward us, but they could be

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.700
shooting it towards other areas in the

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.160
Pacific, or Asia. What we should

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.989
probably do is follow it this time,

00:00:42.989 --> 00:00:44.879
gather as much intelligence as we can,

00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:46.680
see whether the program is successful,

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.960
and also see where they sent it. If they

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.969
do send it towards us, we should make

00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:53.309
clear that US policy in the future is

00:00:53.309 --> 00:00:54.719
to shoot down a North Korean

00:00:54.719 --> 00:00:56.640
ballistic missile during the boost phase,

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.500
regardless of whether it is loaded

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.660
with a nuclear warhead or whether it is

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.859
aimed towards us.

00:01:01.859 --> 00:01:03.420
That's the only way to make sure that

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.519
North Korea knows were serious.

